Template: clientzone/WEBUSER
Type: string
Default: www-data
Description: Web server user
 Application files and caches are owned by this user.

Template: clientzone/SEND_MAILS_FROM
Type: string
Default: shop@yourdomain.net
Description: Send mails from
 Envelope / From address used when the application sends e-mail.

Template: clientzone/SEND_INFO_TO
Type: string
Default: office@yourdomain.net
Description: Notify address
 Address notified about new registrations and orders.

Template: clientzone/EMAIL_FROM
Type: string
Default: shop@yourdomain.net
Description: Default From address
 Default sender address for customer-facing messages.

Template: clientzone/EASE_EMAILTO
Type: string
Default: info@vitexsoftware.cz
Description: Log e-mail recipient
 Where to send application log / operation result e-mails.

Template: clientzone/SUPPRESS_EMAILS
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Suppress e-mails
 If true, no e-mails are sent to customers (useful for testing).

Template: clientzone/ALLOW_REGISTER
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Allow self-registration
 Provide a "Create account" dialog for new customers.

Template: clientzone/REGISTER_USERNAME_IS_EMAIL
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Username must equal the e-mail address
 If true, new customers log in with their e-mail address. Otherwise they choose their own username.

Template: clientzone/REGISTER_VERIFY_EMAIL
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Verify the e-mail address during registration
 If true, the account is created only after the customer opens the confirmation link sent by e-mail.

Template: clientzone/CLIENTZONE_URL
Type: string
Default:
Description: Public base URL of Client Zone
 Used for links in e-mails (e.g. https://zone.example.com/clientzone). Required when e-mail verification is enabled.

Template: clientzone/SHOW_PRICELIST
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Show pricelist
 Show the AbraFlexi pricelist on the client zone homepage.

Template: clientzone/PROD_CAT
Type: string
Default: 1
Description: Pricelist category ID
 AbraFlexi price-list tree node ID shown when the pricelist is enabled.

Template: clientzone/DEBUG
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Debug mode
 Enable verbose logging and debug output.

Template: clientzone/EASE_LOGGER
Type: string
Default: syslog
Description: Ease logger targets
 Comma/pipe separated log writers (e.g. syslog, syslog|console).

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_URL
Type: string
Default: https://demo.flexibee.eu:5434
Description: AbraFlexi API URL
 Full URL with protocol, hostname and port (https://host:5434).

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_LOGIN
Type: string
Default: winstrom
Description: AbraFlexi API login
 User allowed to use the AbraFlexi REST API.

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_PASSWORD
Type: password
Description: AbraFlexi API password
 Password for the AbraFlexi REST API user.

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_COMPANY
Type: string
Default: spoje_net_s_r_o_
Description: AbraFlexi company
 Database / company code opened by default (e.g. spoje_net_s_r_o_).

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_PASSWORD_HASH
Type: select
Choices: plain, sha256, sha512, sha1, md5
Default: sha256
Description: Contact password hashing
 How ClientZone stores contact passwords in AbraFlexi. "plain" keeps
 plaintext; any other value uses AbraFlexi's salted password hash API
 (digest of salt:password). Login still accepts the plaintext password.

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_PASSWORD_SALT
Type: string
Default: 
Description: Fixed password salt (optional)
 Leave empty to generate a random salt for each password write. Set only
 if you need a stable salt across all contacts.

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_PROFORMA_DOCTYPE
Type: string
Default: ZALOHA
Description: Proforma document type code
 AbraFlexi typDokladu code used for advance invoices (without "code:" prefix).

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_BANK_DOCTYPE
Type: string
Default: STAND
Description: Bank document type code
 AbraFlexi bank movement document type code (without "code:" prefix).

Template: clientzone/ABRAFLEXI_STORAGE
Type: string
Default: SKLAD
Description: Default stock / warehouse
 AbraFlexi sklad code used when creating documents.

Template: clientzone/IPEX_URL
Type: string
Default: https://restapi.ipex.cz
Description: IPEX B2B API URL
 Base URL of the IPEX REST API (VoIP credit validation).

Template: clientzone/IPEX_LOGIN
Type: string
Default: 
Description: IPEX API login
 Username for the IPEX B2B API.

Template: clientzone/IPEX_PASSWORD
Type: password
Description: IPEX API password
 Password for the IPEX B2B API.

Template: clientzone/SUBREG_LOCATION
Type: string
Default: https://soap.subreg.cz/cmd.php
Description: Subreg API location
 Subreg SOAP command endpoint URL.

Template: clientzone/SUBREG_URI
Type: string
Default: https://soap.subreg.cz/soap
Description: Subreg SOAP URI
 Subreg SOAP service URI.

Template: clientzone/SUBREG_LOGIN
Type: string
Default: 
Description: Subreg API login
 Username for the Subreg registrar API.

Template: clientzone/SUBREG_PASSWORD
Type: password
Description: Subreg API password
 Password for the Subreg registrar API.
